title  = "Final checkpoint — Continuous Memory complete"
status = "pending"
note   = "All six properties green. cortex is the self-managing memory brain: it owns the durable transcript (provider-agnostic Message store), a multi-resolution temporal ladder (deterministic extractive floor + optional rebuildable enrichment) cascaded hour->day->epoch eagerly on window-close and repaired lazily on read, an Activate composer that hands the agent a budgeted {Pinned, T0, T1, transcript slice, story-so-far, T3 handles} bundle under the p50<80ms discipline with pinned computed once per turn, and a recursive-recall surface that pages exact specifics in on demand (RLM applied to time, depth<=4, as_of preserved). Neo is reduced to Append -> Activate -> render -> transport: the pager selection/ranking, a.summary, a.compact, and the dynamicTail memory sections are gone; story-so-far is durable and survives restart. Every new write rides the derived, journaled-but-not-anchored lane, proven by a replay harness to leave OverallRoot / cortex_snapshot_hash byte-identical (D11 safe). No change to the signed MCL walk or the Liaison boundary. Client surfaces the result, not the protocol. Deploy is user-driven."
